(2374671, 329073, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Having tried something similar I can really appreciate how difficult it is to align the straws in circle!!  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Having tried something similar I can really appreciate how difficult it is to align the straws in circle!!  9', '2006-05-03 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
