(2374894, 329049, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the high key effect.  The movement of the shovel centers the shot. I like the tobacco color of it too. 7</td>', 'I like the high key effect.  The movement of the shovel centers the shot. I like the tobacco color of it too. 7', '2006-05-03 01:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374902, 328372, 56673, '<td valign="top">Repeated theme, but not very rhythmic.</td>', 'Repeated theme, but not very rhythmic.', '2006-05-03 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374903, 326943, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is awesome.  Love the trouble you went to to dye the q-tips.  The undulation is really pretty.  WOW</td>', 'That is awesome.  Love the trouble you went to to dye the q-tips.  The undulation is really pretty.  WOW', '2006-05-03 01:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374911, 327076, 49007, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper, more in focus.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper, more in focus.', '2006-05-03 01:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374917, 328759, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hello and greetings from Gas Works Park in Seattle! Have we met before? <br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this has definitely great potential to it but is somewhat lost. I for one am drawn by the leading line yet there is nothing for my eye to terminate to. A person at the end would have made this stronger in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/> <br/>Rikki</td>', 'Hello and greetings from Gas Works Park in Seattle! Have we met before?  Anyway, I think this has definitely great potential to it but is somewhat lost. I for one am drawn by the leading line yet there is nothing for my eye to terminate to. A person at the end would have made this stronger in my opinion. Cheers, Rikki', '2006-05-03 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
