(2380015, 327710, 23939, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture but I think that it would probally be better if you rotated it to the right a little so the pier was even.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture but I think that it would probally be better if you rotated it to the right a little so the pier was even.', '2006-05-03 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
