(2380199, 329395, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very good example of rhythm and a great photo.  I really like the fade away of the buildings, fills space that could of been blown out sky and at the same time doesn''t distract.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very good example of rhythm and a great photo.  I really like the fade away of the buildings, fills space that could of been blown out sky and at the same time doesn''t distract.  Very nice!', '2006-05-03 23:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2380202, 327280, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very good composition with very dramatic highlight and shadow interplay.  Great photo!</td>', 'Very good composition with very dramatic highlight and shadow interplay.  Great photo!', '2006-05-03 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2380223, 328192, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice ripples.  I wish the ripples were a little brighter, and the sky between the clouds and horizon a little more subdued.</td>', 'Nice ripples.  I wish the ripples were a little brighter, and the sky between the clouds and horizon a little more subdued.', '2006-05-03 23:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2380265, 328630, 55199, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the light seems to be outshining the leaves... perhaps too much contrast?  Also, I think having the top leaflets a little more clear would help.  Nice otherwise. :)</td>', 'The brightness of the light seems to be outshining the leaves... perhaps too much contrast?  Also, I think having the top leaflets a little more clear would help.  Nice otherwise. :)', '2006-05-03 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2380277, 328576, 55199, '<td valign="top">nice curves... like vanilla soft-serve ice-cream, with a pretzel and two mint leaves on the side... mmm.  the greenery and reflections of the skylight give added interest to the left side.  Very nicely composed. :)</td>', 'nice curves... like vanilla soft-serve ice-cream, with a pretzel and two mint leaves on the side... mmm.  the greenery and reflections of the skylight give added interest to the left side.  Very nicely composed. :)', '2006-05-04 00:06:53.000000', NULL, 1);
