(2386897, 328731, 58323, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp....good panning.  It is difficult to tell that the bike is actually really cranked over.....rider probably has his knee scrapping the track...very dramatic. Perhap a front on view would have helped here. Better still a shot looking at the exit of series of tight turns (S bends) with some more riders in the shot...some leaning one way, some the other to create that Rhythmic action. These days it''s getting more difficult to get close to the action so a good 300+ tele might be needed. Cheers.</td>', 'Nice and sharp....good panning.  It is difficult to tell that the bike is actually really cranked over.....rider probably has his knee scrapping the track...very dramatic. Perhap a front on view would have helped here. Better still a shot looking at the exit of series of tight turns (S bends) with some more riders in the shot...some leaning one way, some the other to create that Rhythmic action. These days it''s getting more difficult to get close to the action so a good 300+ tele might be needed. Cheers.', '2006-05-06 04:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386904, 328905, 58323, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have looked real good with the children in focus and the background out of focus....some blur for movement is good.</td>', 'I think this shot would have looked real good with the children in focus and the background out of focus....some blur for movement is good.', '2006-05-06 04:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386910, 329410, 58323, '<td valign="top">Great image...well done.</td>', 'Great image...well done.', '2006-05-06 04:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386928, 329395, 58323, '<td valign="top">Good effort. I would have liked to see his face unobstructed...that might have given the viewer some idea as to what he doing with his hands ?</td>', 'Good effort. I would have liked to see his face unobstructed...that might have given the viewer some idea as to what he doing with his hands ?', '2006-05-06 04:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386958, 328206, 40465, '<td valign="top">I think colour would have given you a higher score...</td>', 'I think colour would have given you a higher score...', '2006-05-06 05:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386966, 329382, 5746, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit too dark. Good idea for this challenge. There''s a rythm in the stairs as well as in the people walking down, but a bit of light would help.</td>', 'I think it''s a bit too dark. Good idea for this challenge. There''s a rythm in the stairs as well as in the people walking down, but a bit of light would help.', '2006-05-06 06:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
