(2386978, 329049, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very good idea with sepia tone here. Looks like a photograph from the beginning of XX century.</td>', 'Very good idea with sepia tone here. Looks like a photograph from the beginning of XX century.', '2006-05-06 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
