(2387000, 328935, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and interesting object. A little more saturation would''ve been helpful. The crop is very tight (probably for good reason), although more context could help as well.</td>', 'Very good idea and interesting object. A little more saturation would''ve been helpful. The crop is very tight (probably for good reason), although more context could help as well.', '2006-05-06 06:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
