(2387003, 328445, 5746, '<td valign="top">The golden buttons (due to the fact that they are of different shapes) disturb a bit. I would suggest cropping them out. Very nice idea. I like the rythm of this one.</td>', 'The golden buttons (due to the fact that they are of different shapes) disturb a bit. I would suggest cropping them out. Very nice idea. I like the rythm of this one.', '2006-05-06 06:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
