(2387028, 329013, 5746, '<td valign="top">The flowers make it very busy. Maybe if there was an opportunity to do it from up or under the red things, the rythm would be much stronger. Beautiful place BTW.</td>', 'The flowers make it very busy. Maybe if there was an opportunity to do it from up or under the red things, the rythm would be much stronger. Beautiful place BTW.', '2006-05-06 07:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
