(2393070, 327006, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very nice pattern and you''ve captured the detail well. I think using a solid colorful background(maybe matching the green in the pattern)or even plain white would have improved this presentation. I would also suggest more even lighting allowing the viewer to see the inside depth all the way around the bowl without the reflection because of this being a rhythm challenge. Just my<br/>humble opinion.</td>', 'Very nice pattern and you''ve captured the detail well. I think using a solid colorful background(maybe matching the green in the pattern)or even plain white would have improved this presentation. I would also suggest more even lighting allowing the viewer to see the inside depth all the way around the bowl without the reflection because of this being a rhythm challenge. Just myhumble opinion.', '2006-05-08 11:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393089, 326983, 52296, '<td valign="top">Great colours, lovely shot!</td>', 'Great colours, lovely shot!', '2006-05-08 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393106, 327899, 8367, '<td valign="top">The compositon of your rhythm conflicts for me. The posts lead your eye to top center but the waves (because of the distinct lines) are leading me to the top right. Interesting capture, though.</td>', 'The compositon of your rhythm conflicts for me. The posts lead your eye to top center but the waves (because of the distinct lines) are leading me to the top right. Interesting capture, though.', '2006-05-08 12:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393110, 328720, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and colors. I''d like to see the center evened up to vertical. It''s slightly off.</td>', 'Nice abstract and colors. I''d like to see the center evened up to vertical. It''s slightly off.', '2006-05-08 12:06:12.000000', NULL, 1);
