(2393143, 327323, 8367, '<td valign="top">Evening light is wonderful and you''ve captured the glow well.<br/>Compositionally, I think this would have been improved by including a tree trunk in the lower right to anchor and balance the photo.</td>', 'Evening light is wonderful and you''ve captured the glow well.Compositionally, I think this would have been improved by including a tree trunk in the lower right to anchor and balance the photo.', '2006-05-08 12:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393171, 328785, 8367, '<td valign="top">You shot this at a great time and captured the shadows perfectly to accentuate the furrows. I think a square crop and slightly adjusting the horizon in pp would improve this compositionally.</td>', 'You shot this at a great time and captured the shadows perfectly to accentuate the furrows. I think a square crop and slightly adjusting the horizon in pp would improve this compositionally.', '2006-05-08 12:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393188, 329351, 8367, '<td valign="top">The highlights/blown areas are pretty distracting.</td>', 'The highlights/blown areas are pretty distracting.', '2006-05-08 12:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393280, 329384, 54731, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the red and orange are too similar and the purple doesn''t stand out much, maybe you should have used a lighter purple... 6</td>', 'I like the idea but the red and orange are too similar and the purple doesn''t stand out much, maybe you should have used a lighter purple... 6', '2006-05-08 13:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393283, 329296, 54731, '<td valign="top">You should have removed the labels and maybe used a smaller aperture, but it looks nice... 6</td>', 'You should have removed the labels and maybe used a smaller aperture, but it looks nice... 6', '2006-05-08 13:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393312, 329073, 8367, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition with the staggering heights. It works well. The background has a pink tint to it on my monitor. To get the even white throughout you would have needed more light on your background as it should have a hotter light than your subject. I also think it would have helped portray more rhythm if you would have grouped your colors. Like white in center, then blue, etc. Just my opinion, it looks fine the way it is.</td>', 'I really like your composition with the staggering heights. It works well. The background has a pink tint to it on my monitor. To get the even white throughout you would have needed more light on your background as it should have a hotter light than your subject. I also think it would have helped portray more rhythm if you would have grouped your colors. Like white in center, then blue, etc. Just my opinion, it looks fine the way it is.', '2006-05-08 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393317, 328735, 56865, '<td valign="top">nice flow to this one</td>', 'nice flow to this one', '2006-05-08 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
