(2396060, 326793, 48592, '<td valign="top">Visually very interesting, full of easily seen contrast.  Greys of wall and frame against neon rainbow slinky, flat wall and wood against slinky spiral web and complex frame pattern.  Light and shadows.  <br/> <br/>I wish it were clearer in focus. I have the feeling that even the nearest slinkies aren''t at center of focus, and me, I would have aimed for either the real slinky closest to the mirror, or the first reflected slinky.  Some slinky should be crisp and clear.</td>', 'Visually very interesting, full of easily seen contrast.  Greys of wall and frame against neon rainbow slinky, flat wall and wood against slinky spiral web and complex frame pattern.  Light and shadows.   I wish it were clearer in focus. I have the feeling that even the nearest slinkies aren''t at center of focus, and me, I would have aimed for either the real slinky closest to the mirror, or the first reflected slinky.  Some slinky should be crisp and clear.', '2006-05-09 05:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
