(2396732, 328972, 57480, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Heavy contrast ads to diagonal. Subject almost perfectly framed, and the sky has nice blue. Had it been more techncally acurate I would mark it a 9-10 but:<br/> <br/>1- slightly out of focus<br/>2- to few shades of blue in the sky showing as artifacts<br/>3- could have waited till the cloud disappeared<br/> <br/>7 :( try to remake it in PS and add it to your prtfolio</td>', 'Nice shot. Heavy contrast ads to diagonal. Subject almost perfectly framed, and the sky has nice blue. Had it been more techncally acurate I would mark it a 9-10 but: 1- slightly out of focus2- to few shades of blue in the sky showing as artifacts3- could have waited till the cloud disappeared 7 :( try to remake it in PS and add it to your prtfolio', '2006-05-09 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
