(2397388, 327459, 58682, '<td valign="top">Very creative! I like the incorperation of the little music note that helps tie together rhythm of music and repetiton for rhythm in the piece. The compostition here is perfectly balanced because although the colors are very virbrant and put weight on one side the note helps to balance out what would be blank space.</td>', 'Very creative! I like the incorperation of the little music note that helps tie together rhythm of music and repetiton for rhythm in the piece. The compostition here is perfectly balanced because although the colors are very virbrant and put weight on one side the note helps to balance out what would be blank space.', '2006-05-09 15:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397390, 329415, 58682, '<td valign="top">interesting with the repetiton of the spirals as well as the reflection of the entire peice. I''m not sure what you used as a backround here but it works well.</td>', 'interesting with the repetiton of the spirals as well as the reflection of the entire peice. I''m not sure what you used as a backround here but it works well.', '2006-05-09 15:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
