(2399193, 328895, 50583, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments guys.  Hopefully I can use them to help me in my next challenge and continue to progress.  I jumped 1.3 points from my first two challenge entries.  :)</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments guys.  Hopefully I can use them to help me in my next challenge and continue to progress.  I jumped 1.3 points from my first two challenge entries.  :)', '2006-05-10 01:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
