(2402587, 329398, 10818, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Rikki.  First, second and third were very close.  <br/> <br/>WTG bud !</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Rikki.  First, second and third were very close.   WTG bud !', '2006-05-10 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2402692, 329148, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like how you light your subjects. There''s a certain style that you carry with each of your entries. You are off to a pretty great start if I don''t say.</td>', 'I really like how you light your subjects. There''s a certain style that you carry with each of your entries. You are off to a pretty great start if I don''t say.', '2006-05-10 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2402712, 329410, 18202, '<td valign="top">Way to go Robert.<br/> <br/>didn''t see you for a while.. Where''ve you been ? <br/> <br/>Btw, Excellent photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Way to go Robert. didn''t see you for a while.. Where''ve you been ?  Btw, Excellent photo! ', '2006-05-10 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2402739, 329141, 10818, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.<br/> <br/>My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great photo. My favorite of the challenge.', '2006-05-10 18:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2402970, 329148, 1031, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the shells of those giant clams : )<br/>Very nice "abstract"</td>', 'This reminds me of the shells of those giant clams : )Very nice "abstract"', '2006-05-10 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403126, 329372, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Bee :)<br/>Making something as simple as this fishing rod look as appealing as this. Really great job with this one, it''s a perfect shot. One of my top5 faves from the challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations, Bee :)Making something as simple as this fishing rod look as appealing as this. Really great job with this one, it''s a perfect shot. One of my top5 faves from the challenge.', '2006-05-10 19:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403137, 327783, 29011, '<td valign="top">Most clever. That''s one really fun illusion!  <br/>Congratulations on the top10.</td>', 'Most clever. That''s one really fun illusion!  Congratulations on the top10.', '2006-05-10 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403165, 326943, 92, '<td valign="top">Love the beautiful bright colors ! You got rhythm !</td>', 'Love the beautiful bright colors ! You got rhythm !', '2006-05-10 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403229, 329372, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its a fantastic photo.  You really captured the shot well.  It has a great tones and I love the DOF.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your top 10 !</td>', 'Its a fantastic photo.  You really captured the shot well.  It has a great tones and I love the DOF. Congrats on your top 10 !', '2006-05-10 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403271, 327624, 12268, '<td valign="top">The idea here is interesting, I like it. The shot comes off a bit flat to me &amp; the ''rhythm'' here is subtle. I''ve found that subtly does not bode well here at DPC. I imagine this is a ballon of sorts. Perhaps panning out a bit to include more to the pic might have bumped up your shot. Also a bit more in contrast &amp; a different colour border might have made things a bit less flat  IMHO.</td>', 'The idea here is interesting, I like it. The shot comes off a bit flat to me & the ''rhythm'' here is subtle. I''ve found that subtly does not bode well here at DPC. I imagine this is a ballon of sorts. Perhaps panning out a bit to include more to the pic might have bumped up your shot. Also a bit more in contrast & a different colour border might have made things a bit less flat  IMHO.', '2006-05-10 19:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403283, 328898, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a nice clean shot. I really don''t think you USM-ed it too much, it seems just right to me. I think the angle is a bit off &amp; perhaps the use of both the train tracks &amp; the train competes with one another as the focal point as both have distinct repeating patterns.</td>', 'This is a nice clean shot. I really don''t think you USM-ed it too much, it seems just right to me. I think the angle is a bit off & perhaps the use of both the train tracks & the train competes with one another as the focal point as both have distinct repeating patterns.', '2006-05-10 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403310, 329005, 6519, '<td valign="top">Wooo hooo, Shez - you''re gettin'' gooder and gooder  :-)</td>', 'Wooo hooo, Shez - you''re gettin'' gooder and gooder  :-)', '2006-05-10 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403419, 329395, 42125, '<td valign="top">Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)<br/>Congratulations on your highest score. This is quite good.<br/><b>First impression</b> <br/>1. Good rithm<br/>2. Bright and lovely colours<br/>3. Good applying of rule of thirds and leading lines.<br/>4. Contrast and focus good on main subject.<br/><b>What could be better?</b> <br/>1. The houses are a bit to bright.<br/>2. I would like to see a bit more of the others in focus. Probably not possible.<br/>3. The person to the right looks a bit grainy. Maybe applying of NeatImage would have helped.<br/>4. Try to care for the score - that helps make improvements :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-10 20:28:59.</i></td>', 'Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)Congratulations on your highest score. This is quite good.First impression 1. Good rithm2. Bright and lovely colours3. Good applying of rule of thirds and leading lines.4. Contrast and focus good on main subject.What could be better? 1. The houses are a bit to bright.2. I would like to see a bit more of the others in focus. Probably not possible.3. The person to the right looks a bit grainy. Maybe applying of NeatImage would have helped.4. Try to care for the score - that helps make improvements :-)', '2006-05-10 20:20:46.000000', '2006-05-10 21:28:59.000000', 0),
(2403437, 329398, 51988, '<td valign="top">Great shot Rikki! Congrats on the well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Great shot Rikki! Congrats on the well deserved ribbon!', '2006-05-10 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403500, 329304, 46853, '<td valign="top">það er nú alltaf gaman af svona bátamyndum</td>', 'það er nú alltaf gaman af svona bátamyndum', '2006-05-10 20:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403751, 327716, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and crisp.  At first I wasn''t sure I liked the break in the upper canvas but I think it adds an interesting element.  I might have cropped the first two targets out and had just the six, with the swoosh of canvas.  Challenge is well-met with this picture.</td>', 'Very sharp and crisp.  At first I wasn''t sure I liked the break in the upper canvas but I think it adds an interesting element.  I might have cropped the first two targets out and had just the six, with the swoosh of canvas.  Challenge is well-met with this picture.', '2006-05-10 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403757, 327783, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice work congrats !<br/></td>', 'nice work congrats !', '2006-05-10 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403792, 329415, 42125, '<td valign="top">Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)<br/><b>First impression</b> <br/>1. What is this?<br/>2. Beautiful thing but what is it?<br/>3. On a mirror but what is it?<br/>4. Good focus<br/>5. Nice setup.<br/>6. Is this plastic behind the thing that I do not know what is?<br/><b>What could be better</b> <br/>1. Looks a bit grainy in the left side above the ......<br/>2. Put a frame on it to stop the Viewer from going out of the picture<br/>Nothing more to say. Hope my wonderings help.</td>', 'Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)First impression 1. What is this?2. Beautiful thing but what is it?3. On a mirror but what is it?4. Good focus5. Nice setup.6. Is this plastic behind the thing that I do not know what is?What could be better 1. Looks a bit grainy in the left side above the ......2. Put a frame on it to stop the Viewer from going out of the pictureNothing more to say. Hope my wonderings help.', '2006-05-10 21:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403798, 329346, 29490, '<td valign="top">This has "hang me on a wall where others can see" written all over it, I am humbled by your creativity and ability.</td>', 'This has "hang me on a wall where others can see" written all over it, I am humbled by your creativity and ability.', '2006-05-10 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403815, 329398, 38267, '<td valign="top">You = The Man :)</td>', 'You = The Man :)', '2006-05-10 21:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403868, 329353, 11181, '<td valign="top">Well done! Congrats congrats congrats! Very interested to know how this was done though :)</td>', 'Well done! Congrats congrats congrats! Very interested to know how this was done though :)', '2006-05-10 22:05:37.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2403877, 327708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>I gave this a 6 in voting.  What made it work well for me is not just the rhythm/repetition of the flower, but the curve of the mirror and the lines/curves of whatever is behind it.  Balance and composition of the picture are very good.<br/> <br/>I''m a kind of monochromatic person so the blue/green in the reflection didn''t suit me at first, but in looking at it again, it adds depth to the reflection.  Should you want to remove it, you can by adjusting the color balance, increasing red, magenta and yellow (ie effectively decreasing blue, green, and cyan.)</td>', 'Trading Post commentI gave this a 6 in voting.  What made it work well for me is not just the rhythm/repetition of the flower, but the curve of the mirror and the lines/curves of whatever is behind it.  Balance and composition of the picture are very good. I''m a kind of monochromatic person so the blue/green in the reflection didn''t suit me at first, but in looking at it again, it adds depth to the reflection.  Should you want to remove it, you can by adjusting the color balance, increasing red, magenta and yellow (ie effectively decreasing blue, green, and cyan.)', '2006-05-10 22:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403881, 326943, 58615, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon and you did it pretty quickly. Nicely done.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon and you did it pretty quickly. Nicely done.', '2006-05-10 22:08:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403912, 327280, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Awesome, Eric!  This one grabbed me right away, but I don''t always comment during voting on those I figure are going to finish well - I figure they get enough comments.  Great lines and good balance of the sunlit side to the dark side.  Very well seen and well executed.  Congrats!!</td>', 'Trading Post commentAwesome, Eric!  This one grabbed me right away, but I don''t always comment during voting on those I figure are going to finish well - I figure they get enough comments.  Great lines and good balance of the sunlit side to the dark side.  Very well seen and well executed.  Congrats!!', '2006-05-10 22:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403948, 327006, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>I liked this as a choice for the challenge, particularly given the title.  I may have preferred less of a direct angle, though that may not have created the pattern as well.  I do think a more colorful background would have brought out the subject better, and maybe red berries in the bowl - though that may be too much.  Lighting looks pretty good to me.  Focus is a bit soft but may just need a touch more unsharp mask to correct.  By the way, it''s pretty striking if you desaturate it to black and white.</td>', 'Trading Post commentI liked this as a choice for the challenge, particularly given the title.  I may have preferred less of a direct angle, though that may not have created the pattern as well.  I do think a more colorful background would have brought out the subject better, and maybe red berries in the bowl - though that may be too much.  Lighting looks pretty good to me.  Focus is a bit soft but may just need a touch more unsharp mask to correct.  By the way, it''s pretty striking if you desaturate it to black and white.', '2006-05-10 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2403973, 329159, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>This was by far the best "piano" shot.  This is the kind of picture I really like, the kind I look for, too.  The lines, different textures, muted colors all work very well together.<br/> <br/>The reason this didn''t score higher - it''s not bold and flashy.  This is a quiet picture that requires a viewer to linger a bit to really appreciate it.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Trading Post commentThis was by far the best "piano" shot.  This is the kind of picture I really like, the kind I look for, too.  The lines, different textures, muted colors all work very well together. The reason this didn''t score higher - it''s not bold and flashy.  This is a quiet picture that requires a viewer to linger a bit to really appreciate it.  Very nice work!', '2006-05-10 22:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404024, 329304, 38496, '<td valign="top">From comment trading post:<br/> <br/>I really like the repetition of the lines on the boats.  The reflection adds to the impact.  The colors are nice and bright.  The white top of the white boat takes away a tiny bit.  Not much, though.  Maybe cropping a bit lower would help?.  Overall a very pleasing photo.</td>', 'From comment trading post: I really like the repetition of the lines on the boats.  The reflection adds to the impact.  The colors are nice and bright.  The white top of the white boat takes away a tiny bit.  Not much, though.  Maybe cropping a bit lower would help?.  Overall a very pleasing photo.', '2006-05-10 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404099, 327280, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>Way to go - front page and that cool star by your title. Congratulations on a great score and placement. Very cool shot of a very cool building. The angle is great and just makes the lines, highlights and shadows work all the better. I have no comments on how to make this any better. Very nice work.</td>', 'Trading Post -Way to go - front page and that cool star by your title. Congratulations on a great score and placement. Very cool shot of a very cool building. The angle is great and just makes the lines, highlights and shadows work all the better. I have no comments on how to make this any better. Very nice work.', '2006-05-10 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404103, 326943, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an awesome, creative shot!  And you make it look so easy.  It''s the thinking of cool stuff like this that''s so hard!  Congratulations on your first (of many I''m sure) ribbon! <br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  What an awesome, creative shot!  And you make it look so easy.  It''s the thinking of cool stuff like this that''s so hard!  Congratulations on your first (of many I''m sure) ribbon!  ', '2006-05-10 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404150, 328898, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/>Nice shot Deb. This may have done better in a lines challenge. The angle and depth of this shot work really well. The colors are nice as well. Not sure what you could do to improve this. In advanced editing some spot saturation would have worked out well I think.</td>', 'Trading Post - Nice shot Deb. This may have done better in a lines challenge. The angle and depth of this shot work really well. The colors are nice as well. Not sure what you could do to improve this. In advanced editing some spot saturation would have worked out well I think.', '2006-05-10 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404171, 329159, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>I think you had the start of something good here. It would have been nice for the focus to be sharp on the wires. I have no clue what the inside of a piano looks like, but I think that if the shot was pulled back some maybe there would have been more "stuff" to draw in interest. Overall I think that more focus on everything would have served you well.</td>', 'Trading Post -I think you had the start of something good here. It would have been nice for the focus to be sharp on the wires. I have no clue what the inside of a piano looks like, but I think that if the shot was pulled back some maybe there would have been more "stuff" to draw in interest. Overall I think that more focus on everything would have served you well.', '2006-05-10 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404469, 329395, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> <br/>Postive. I really like this. <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>I wouldn''t change anything. I love the depth the image has, which is carried out well with the composition.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Interesting. It''s one of those images where you look at it and want to look more. <br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Nothing wrong here. The exposure works for me. The color is alive, which was how the event itself must have been like. <br/> <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>None really. <br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Great photo. I like how you kept the grain in this shot. <br/> <br/>Like always, it''s just my opinion/suggestions. Good luck and I look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  First Impression: Postive. I really like this.  Composition: I wouldn''t change anything. I love the depth the image has, which is carried out well with the composition. Subject: Interesting. It''s one of those images where you look at it and want to look more.  Technical (Colour and light): Nothing wrong here. The exposure works for me. The color is alive, which was how the event itself must have been like.  Improvement: None really.  Summary: Great photo. I like how you kept the grain in this shot.  Like always, it''s just my opinion/suggestions. Good luck and I look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2006-05-11 00:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404498, 329395, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi OJ!<br/> <br/>I actually scored this an 8 in voting. It''s a really cool picture. Maybe the city in the background is a bit overexposed, but we can see everything that you really intended for us to see. Perhaps a bit of a noise issue, but that''s really all. The rhythm here is both in the line and in the implied dance, which is a great double entendre for the challenge. :-)</td>', 'Hi OJ! I actually scored this an 8 in voting. It''s a really cool picture. Maybe the city in the background is a bit overexposed, but we can see everything that you really intended for us to see. Perhaps a bit of a noise issue, but that''s really all. The rhythm here is both in the line and in the implied dance, which is a great double entendre for the challenge. :-)', '2006-05-11 00:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404499, 328749, 8891, '<td valign="top">Oh I''ve been around....you certainly beat me. Congrats on your new BP. Also congrats on your DigiCam Plus POTD today!</td>', 'Oh I''ve been around....you certainly beat me. Congrats on your new BP. Also congrats on your DigiCam Plus POTD today!', '2006-05-11 00:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404531, 329415, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Shailesh!<br/> <br/>Is it a telephone cord? I can''t tell what it is, though I didn''t hold this against you in voting. I think what puts me off the most about this is that the red seems oversaturated while the rest has no color at all and I''m puzzled by this choice. It''s difficult to say anything about an abstract, however, that isn''t just a matter of personal taste. You finished well with it, so good job!</td>', 'Hi Shailesh! Is it a telephone cord? I can''t tell what it is, though I didn''t hold this against you in voting. I think what puts me off the most about this is that the red seems oversaturated while the rest has no color at all and I''m puzzled by this choice. It''s difficult to say anything about an abstract, however, that isn''t just a matter of personal taste. You finished well with it, so good job!', '2006-05-11 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404571, 329304, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Gunnar -<br/> <br/>I like the rhythm of the boat lines - definitely a unique perspective on the challenge. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure what to do about the overwhelming brightness of the white except maybe turn the shutter speed up a notch and let the color come out in post-production, perhaps via saturation and lightness controls? Overall, not a bad finish at 55, though. Good eye!</td>', 'Hi Gunnar - I like the rhythm of the boat lines - definitely a unique perspective on the challenge.  I''m not sure what to do about the overwhelming brightness of the white except maybe turn the shutter speed up a notch and let the color come out in post-production, perhaps via saturation and lightness controls? Overall, not a bad finish at 55, though. Good eye!', '2006-05-11 01:28:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404748, 329353, 41411, '<td valign="top">too much neatimage</td>', 'too much neatimage', '2006-05-11 02:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2404954, 329304, 40465, '<td valign="top">Very colourful, which is always good:)<br/>I like the way the boats ''overlap'' the yellow one, it kinda frames the awesome reflection.<br/> the top of the boat and the rope are a bit distracting, but if you crop it out then the pretty blue is lost...<br/> <br/>Nice score and placing, well done:)</td>', 'Very colourful, which is always good:)I like the way the boats ''overlap'' the yellow one, it kinda frames the awesome reflection. the top of the boat and the rope are a bit distracting, but if you crop it out then the pretty blue is lost... Nice score and placing, well done:)', '2006-05-11 04:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405075, 328749, 18202, '<td valign="top">You usually beat me by far. I deserve this little sweet victory ;-)<br/>Haha, I didn''t even know I won.. thanks for telling me.<br/></td>', 'You usually beat me by far. I deserve this little sweet victory ;-)Haha, I didn''t even know I won.. thanks for telling me.', '2006-05-11 06:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405103, 329398, 35720, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. Great shot with wonderful combination of light, colours and shapes. Excellent work.</td>', 'Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. Great shot with wonderful combination of light, colours and shapes. Excellent work.', '2006-05-11 06:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405177, 329284, 34192, '<td valign="top">as you know by now, the high votes here go to the bright and shiny.  But this image deserves a second and third glance - something it obviously didn''t get.  The more I look at this image, the more I realize it couldn''t be taken any other way.  Your editing has given movement to the rhythm.  I can hear the echo so, for me, this fits perfectly in the challenge.  Well seen, well taken, well done.  You know, its almost too much.  They are so in sync I want to, I don''t know, slap them out of it.  Not only did you give us rhythm, you gave us a deeper look into the subjects as well.</td>', 'as you know by now, the high votes here go to the bright and shiny.  But this image deserves a second and third glance - something it obviously didn''t get.  The more I look at this image, the more I realize it couldn''t be taken any other way.  Your editing has given movement to the rhythm.  I can hear the echo so, for me, this fits perfectly in the challenge.  Well seen, well taken, well done.  You know, its almost too much.  They are so in sync I want to, I don''t know, slap them out of it.  Not only did you give us rhythm, you gave us a deeper look into the subjects as well.', '2006-05-11 07:42:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405181, 329383, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2006-05-11 07:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405200, 326943, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, congratulations on your first ribbon.</td>', 'Very colorful, congratulations on your first ribbon.', '2006-05-11 08:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405205, 329353, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats to ya Cam!</td>', 'Congrats to ya Cam!', '2006-05-11 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405216, 329398, 22689, '<td valign="top"><b>From the Critique Club :</b> <br/> <br/>Hi Rikki !<br/> <br/>Congrats for your ribbon ! <br/>Now with 3 blue and 3 yellow , my advice is to go to the red ones ! ;-)<br/> <br/>After all the comments you received and the score , there''s not really much to add and even less advices to improve the photo. <br/>Only my opinion : I really like this creative photo because with simple elements you have produced an impactive and colorful shot , that''s brilliant ! The only secret here is maybe the lighting , you know very well how to use the light (as we all know).<br/> <br/>You have met almost all your goals for year 2006 and it''s still may ...<br/>OMG ! What''s next ?<br/> <br/></td>', 'From the Critique Club :  Hi Rikki ! Congrats for your ribbon ! Now with 3 blue and 3 yellow , my advice is to go to the red ones ! ;-) After all the comments you received and the score , there''s not really much to add and even less advices to improve the photo. Only my opinion : I really like this creative photo because with simple elements you have produced an impactive and colorful shot , that''s brilliant ! The only secret here is maybe the lighting , you know very well how to use the light (as we all know). You have met almost all your goals for year 2006 and it''s still may ...OMG ! What''s next ? ', '2006-05-11 08:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405219, 329398, 5728, '<td valign="top">Like I said, very Rikki-ed :)</td>', 'Like I said, very Rikki-ed :)', '2006-05-11 08:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405221, 329395, 40465, '<td valign="top">Hi from CP2!<br/> <br/>This is such a cool shot!!<br/>The colous are great and the perspective is good!!<br/> <br/>I would have liked to see more of the girls in focus though.<br/>The guy''s chest seems a bit grainy...<br/> <br/>I love it:)<br/>Well done on 52nd and a personal best:)</td>', 'Hi from CP2! This is such a cool shot!!The colous are great and the perspective is good!! I would have liked to see more of the girls in focus though.The guy''s chest seems a bit grainy... I love it:)Well done on 52nd and a personal best:)', '2006-05-11 08:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405223, 329415, 40465, '<td valign="top">Hi from CP2!!<br/> <br/>Nice use of colour.<br/>The focus is good.<br/> <br/>The plastic(or whatever it is) in the background gives an interesting texture, but its a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>Hope it helped:)</td>', 'Hi from CP2!! Nice use of colour.The focus is good. The plastic(or whatever it is) in the background gives an interesting texture, but its a bit distracting. Hope it helped:)', '2006-05-11 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405273, 329005, 20941, '<td valign="top">WOW !!! Congratulations on your 5th placing with this wonderful rainbow of color and composition!</td>', 'WOW !!! Congratulations on your 5th placing with this wonderful rainbow of color and composition!', '2006-05-11 09:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405330, 327006, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/> <br/>Hmmm. This one left me a bit flat. Its nice that you have the decorations arranged symmetrically. I dont know if its the decoratiosn or the focus but it seems just a wee bit soft. The colors are a bit flat - but I think thats just the way they are. I think what would have made this better would be to crop the shot or take the shot that takes in only a quarter of your objects. When I resize my page to just show the lower right corner from the center of the bowl the pic becomes a bit more interesting. Even a hlaf shot may have been better. The whole plate set in the square crop just doesnt do much for me. Half shot could give more of an interesting balance of light and shadows and maybe even make you look at it a bitlonger to think about what it was you were looking at instead of opening up the shot and seeing "plate, plate, bowl".</td>', 'Trading Post - Hmmm. This one left me a bit flat. Its nice that you have the decorations arranged symmetrically. I dont know if its the decoratiosn or the focus but it seems just a wee bit soft. The colors are a bit flat - but I think thats just the way they are. I think what would have made this better would be to crop the shot or take the shot that takes in only a quarter of your objects. When I resize my page to just show the lower right corner from the center of the bowl the pic becomes a bit more interesting. Even a hlaf shot may have been better. The whole plate set in the square crop just doesnt do much for me. Half shot could give more of an interesting balance of light and shadows and maybe even make you look at it a bitlonger to think about what it was you were looking at instead of opening up the shot and seeing "plate, plate, bowl".', '2006-05-11 09:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405348, 327708, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>You have a good idea to start. This is the same idea as the slinky shot in this same challenge. I had a couple of issues withthis one. The colors were not as vibrant as they could have been. Same with the sharpness. I have never set up a shot like this, but more of a curve going into the mirrors would be nice. The slinky shot had a very nice curve going back. Also th eflowers just blend together toomuch as they go back and with such a vatiety o flines within the head of the flower the detail and separation just seem to get lost. I may hav ealso cropped the top off just above the second curve. The vertical lines above arent necessary and the blown out white doesnt seem to fit well IMO.</td>', 'Trading Post -You have a good idea to start. This is the same idea as the slinky shot in this same challenge. I had a couple of issues withthis one. The colors were not as vibrant as they could have been. Same with the sharpness. I have never set up a shot like this, but more of a curve going into the mirrors would be nice. The slinky shot had a very nice curve going back. Also th eflowers just blend together toomuch as they go back and with such a vatiety o flines within the head of the flower the detail and separation just seem to get lost. I may hav ealso cropped the top off just above the second curve. The vertical lines above arent necessary and the blown out white doesnt seem to fit well IMO.', '2006-05-11 09:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405369, 329304, 24503, '<td valign="top">From the CTP MkII <br/> <br/>First Impression: I like it. Dynamic.<br/> <br/>Composition: Like composition for this challenge, as you keep moving from one side of the image to other.<br/> <br/>Subject: Beautiful. I love boats. Aren''t they a wonderful subject for photography?<br/> <br/>Technical: the colours are a little bit washed IMHO. I think they need some more saturation and texture, but maybe it''s just my monitor. The white of the upper boat is blowed.<br/> <br/>Improvement: It''s a pitty it was basic editing, if not you could work a little bit more the boats to recover more colour.<br/> <br/>Summary: Very good comp, very good for the challenge, needs a bit more saturarion and texture.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'From the CTP MkII  First Impression: I like it. Dynamic. Composition: Like composition for this challenge, as you keep moving from one side of the image to other. Subject: Beautiful. I love boats. Aren''t they a wonderful subject for photography? Technical: the colours are a little bit washed IMHO. I think they need some more saturation and texture, but maybe it''s just my monitor. The white of the upper boat is blowed. Improvement: It''s a pitty it was basic editing, if not you could work a little bit more the boats to recover more colour. Summary: Very good comp, very good for the challenge, needs a bit more saturarion and texture. Álex', '2006-05-11 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405589, 329383, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of the fern fronds.  The filter works for impact as well. If you could''ve used advanced, I would have liked some burn on the individual leaves, to really bring out the detail.</td>', 'I like the repetition of the fern fronds.  The filter works for impact as well. If you could''ve used advanced, I would have liked some burn on the individual leaves, to really bring out the detail.', '2006-05-11 11:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405746, 326943, 8367, '<td valign="top">This is such a creative capture. Well done and congratulations!!</td>', 'This is such a creative capture. Well done and congratulations!!', '2006-05-11 12:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405813, 329415, 24503, '<td valign="top">From the CTP MkII <br/> <br/>First Impression: Nice and rhythmic studio shot.<br/> <br/>Composition: very good diagonal from left bottom to upper right.<br/> <br/>Subject: Quite interesting subject for this challenge. It creates a nice sense of rhythm, with the reflection.<br/> <br/>Technical: Very good light and DOF.<br/> <br/>Improvement: I don''t like the BG, it''s distracting to me, sorry. I think it would have worked better with a black BG, but it''s just an opinion.<br/> <br/>Summary: Very nice shot with good lightening.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'From the CTP MkII  First Impression: Nice and rhythmic studio shot. Composition: very good diagonal from left bottom to upper right. Subject: Quite interesting subject for this challenge. It creates a nice sense of rhythm, with the reflection. Technical: Very good light and DOF. Improvement: I don''t like the BG, it''s distracting to me, sorry. I think it would have worked better with a black BG, but it''s just an opinion. Summary: Very nice shot with good lightening. Álex', '2006-05-11 12:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405977, 329372, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this image!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Love this image!  Congratulations.', '2006-05-11 13:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
