(2408321, 329415, 38496, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo!  I really like the colors and the lighting.  And can''t argue with fitting the challenge.  The only slightly bothersome thing is that parts of the background are a little distracting.  Actually, maybe I like it that way... can''t decide.  It looks good in the foreground part of the image.<br/>Overall I liked this a lot, and can''t suggest anything to improve.<br/>So what is it, anyway??</td>', 'Very cool photo!  I really like the colors and the lighting.  And can''t argue with fitting the challenge.  The only slightly bothersome thing is that parts of the background are a little distracting.  Actually, maybe I like it that way... can''t decide.  It looks good in the foreground part of the image.Overall I liked this a lot, and can''t suggest anything to improve.So what is it, anyway??', '2006-05-12 01:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
