(2412649, 329085, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>I like this picture alot more than strange Q-tip rainbow thingy that one the challange. The picture really fits the challange. There isn''t much I think you could have done better. Maby the crop. A bit more negative space on the left side and top maby? <br/> <br/>Good luck in future challanges :)<br/> <br/>Best regard, Arni<br/><a href="//www.torfason.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.torfason.is</a></td>', 'Critique Club:I like this picture alot more than strange Q-tip rainbow thingy that one the challange. The picture really fits the challange. There isn''t much I think you could have done better. Maby the crop. A bit more negative space on the left side and top maby?  Good luck in future challanges :) Best regard, Arni//www.torfason.is', '2006-05-13 18:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2412660, 329161, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>I really like the shapes in this picture. My eyes goes all over... round after round after round :) In my opinion there are a few things that might make this picture better. Not sure if they are all correct but this is what I think.<br/>1. Contrast. I think it could have a bit more contrast in it. The color in the edges could be darker.<br/>2. Crop. I think a slightly wider crop. Maby where you can see the edges of the flower and have lot of dof in it.<br/>3. Dirt on flower. I know you couldn''t have done nothing about because of the basic editing but the dark spots on the flowers are a bit disctracting.<br/>4. Larger drops. Have some larger waterdrops?<br/> <br/>I think that is about it...<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challanges :)<br/> <br/>Best regard, Arni<br/><a href="//www.torfason.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.torfason.is</a></td>', 'Critique Club:I really like the shapes in this picture. My eyes goes all over... round after round after round :) In my opinion there are a few things that might make this picture better. Not sure if they are all correct but this is what I think.1. Contrast. I think it could have a bit more contrast in it. The color in the edges could be darker.2. Crop. I think a slightly wider crop. Maby where you can see the edges of the flower and have lot of dof in it.3. Dirt on flower. I know you couldn''t have done nothing about because of the basic editing but the dark spots on the flowers are a bit disctracting.4. Larger drops. Have some larger waterdrops? I think that is about it... Good luck in future challanges :) Best regard, Arni//www.torfason.is', '2006-05-13 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2412661, 328001, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>The colors in this shot are just amazing. The white/blue cup agains the reddish/orange background is just perfect. The composition is good and the border is just spot on. The only thing I think could have been done better is what is reflectin in the cup. Maby if there where something more beautiful reflecting. Like a flower or a face or just something. Just some ideas :)<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challanges :)<br/> <br/>Best regard, Arni<br/><a href="//www.torfason.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.torfason.is</a></td>', 'Critique Club:The colors in this shot are just amazing. The white/blue cup agains the reddish/orange background is just perfect. The composition is good and the border is just spot on. The only thing I think could have been done better is what is reflectin in the cup. Maby if there where something more beautiful reflecting. Like a flower or a face or just something. Just some ideas :) Good luck in future challanges :) Best regard, Arni//www.torfason.is', '2006-05-13 18:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2412668, 329361, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>The subject isn''t that bad. The idea is good but the executin isn''t that great. The colors are good. Like the brownish feelding of this picture. I think you could use this background for future shots. It looks like fun to shoot. In this photo the main subject is hard to spot. Is it the shades, is it the table, is it the white light coming in, is it the mirror? My idea for this would have been to take a close up of the reflection at the end of the table. For your first challange this isn''t so bad. Keep it up and don''t quit.<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challanges :)<br/> <br/>Best regard, Arni<br/><a href="//www.torfason.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.torfason.is</a></td>', 'Critique Club:The subject isn''t that bad. The idea is good but the executin isn''t that great. The colors are good. Like the brownish feelding of this picture. I think you could use this background for future shots. It looks like fun to shoot. In this photo the main subject is hard to spot. Is it the shades, is it the table, is it the white light coming in, is it the mirror? My idea for this would have been to take a close up of the reflection at the end of the table. For your first challange this isn''t so bad. Keep it up and don''t quit. Good luck in future challanges :) Best regard, Arni//www.torfason.is', '2006-05-13 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2412679, 328334, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>Hey Brittany. Like the idea alot! There is not only rhytm in the picture but pianos make rhythm so that''s two in one :) There are a few things that could have made this picture better.<br/>1. Focus. The focus seems to be a little off. Don''t know where it is excatly. Having the focus maby on the third or fourth note would have been excellent.<br/>2. Contrast. I think the white notes should have more contrast in them. Whiter.<br/> <br/>Overall I like the feeling in this picture.<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challanges :)<br/> <br/>Best regard, Arni<br/><a href="//www.torfason.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.torfason.is</a></td>', 'Critique Club:Hey Brittany. Like the idea alot! There is not only rhytm in the picture but pianos make rhythm so that''s two in one :) There are a few things that could have made this picture better.1. Focus. The focus seems to be a little off. Don''t know where it is excatly. Having the focus maby on the third or fourth note would have been excellent.2. Contrast. I think the white notes should have more contrast in them. Whiter. Overall I like the feeling in this picture. Good luck in future challanges :) Best regard, Arni//www.torfason.is', '2006-05-13 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
