(2416038, 328898, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post--<br/>Very nice, and one of the better rhythm shots in my opinion.  The composition is terrific, and I do feel drawn deep into the photo.  The shot is nicely crisp, and I also do not believe that the USM is too much.  I would like to see the sky a deeper blue, perhaps with a CP filter during the shot.  Nice work, as well seen.</td>', '--Trading Post--Very nice, and one of the better rhythm shots in my opinion.  The composition is terrific, and I do feel drawn deep into the photo.  The shot is nicely crisp, and I also do not believe that the USM is too much.  I would like to see the sky a deeper blue, perhaps with a CP filter during the shot.  Nice work, as well seen.', '2006-05-15 01:59:14.000000', NULL, 0),
