(2419922, 329005, 48115, '<td valign="top">this photo is so lovely i cant even say how much i like it.. I think your work is inspiering, so colourfull and just so over all lovely. There is only one thing i can see in this photo that i would maybe have changed.. i would have liked to see a solid black background. but what do i know :) keep it up :)</td>', 'this photo is so lovely i cant even say how much i like it.. I think your work is inspiering, so colourfull and just so over all lovely. There is only one thing i can see in this photo that i would maybe have changed.. i would have liked to see a solid black background. but what do i know :) keep it up :)', '2006-05-16 07:08:35.000000', NULL, 0),
