(2429194, 327280, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>this is a nice lmage, but I think you should have waited a few hours before shooting, that bright sun burns out to big part of the image wher you could have great details if you''d wait for the sun to go away :)<br/></td>', '[[trading post]] this is a nice lmage, but I think you should have waited a few hours before shooting, that bright sun burns out to big part of the image wher you could have great details if you''d wait for the sun to go away :)', '2006-05-18 08:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2434206, 326793, 55773, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot, so creative.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot, so creative.', '2006-05-19 07:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2436667, 329109, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/>I really like the illusion you captured. In addition to having that note in there I like how you can see this as a bunch of straws or as a bunch of tiny balls stacked together. The color also works pretty well as just an abstract even if you don''t notice the note framed by it. The composition is also on target. <br/> <br/>The only thing that seems a little odd to me are the straws that make up the note, which are not as sharp as the others. <br/> <br/>In terms of improving your score in the challenges, I would suggest going with a cleaner look and by that I mean having those straws that define the note as sharp as the others. That''s really it. I like abstracts and this is a good abstract.</td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  I really like the illusion you captured. In addition to having that note in there I like how you can see this as a bunch of straws or as a bunch of tiny balls stacked together. The color also works pretty well as just an abstract even if you don''t notice the note framed by it. The composition is also on target.  The only thing that seems a little odd to me are the straws that make up the note, which are not as sharp as the others.  In terms of improving your score in the challenges, I would suggest going with a cleaner look and by that I mean having those straws that define the note as sharp as the others. That''s really it. I like abstracts and this is a good abstract.', '2006-05-19 15:57:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2439655, 329118, 36470, '<td valign="top">Underated, IMO.  Love the simpleness of the composition.  Looks great on my calibrated monitor :)</td>', 'Underated, IMO.  Love the simpleness of the composition.  Looks great on my calibrated monitor :)', '2006-05-20 08:14:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2440614, 328714, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks TC,<br/> <br/>I agree in all your points, execept the pots :), they are just plastic pots for growing the seeds during the first weeks, they do not have texture and interest at all.<br/> <br/>The drops in the glass was just laziness... I saw them but I was tired to clean them 200 times after water dry and I had to add more drops in the plants<br/> <br/>Next year we will try again, the plants are already in the garden :)</td>', 'Thanks TC, I agree in all your points, execept the pots :), they are just plastic pots for growing the seeds during the first weeks, they do not have texture and interest at all. The drops in the glass was just laziness... I saw them but I was tired to clean them 200 times after water dry and I had to add more drops in the plants Next year we will try again, the plants are already in the garden :)', '2006-05-20 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2441350, 329346, 6349, '<td valign="top">oh... i''m so sorry i missed this during the challenge.</td>', 'oh... i''m so sorry i missed this during the challenge.', '2006-05-20 20:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
