(2480685, 328372, 16241, '<td valign="top">great idea, i always look at these little buggers and wonder how<br/>to photography them.  lets have a shopping trolley challenge!</td>', 'great idea, i always look at these little buggers and wonder howto photography them.  lets have a shopping trolley challenge!', '2006-06-03 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2481079, 327280, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, evocative of rhythm, that uses the artificial tilt caused by photographing "upwards" objects to great effect.  Everything from the full depth of field to the sharpness, shadows, and colour work excellently.  I think that side of the building that''s in shadow works well to contrast with the highlighted area in middle, and the lighter tones at left.  The sky has a great dark to light gradient that really satisfies.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a great image, evocative of rhythm, that uses the artificial tilt caused by photographing "upwards" objects to great effect.  Everything from the full depth of field to the sharpness, shadows, and colour work excellently.  I think that side of the building that''s in shadow works well to contrast with the highlighted area in middle, and the lighter tones at left.  The sky has a great dark to light gradient that really satisfies.  Well done.', '2006-06-03 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2481638, 328696, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition :) Nice catch :)</td>', 'Very cool composition :) Nice catch :)', '2006-06-03 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485229, 329427, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice abstract Becky. I think it would look great on the wall too. You should try it with a wide black-on-black mat and a nice frame.</td>', 'This is a very nice abstract Becky. I think it would look great on the wall too. You should try it with a wide black-on-black mat and a nice frame.', '2006-06-05 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494963, 327819, 37779, '<td valign="top">You captured the perfect movement in this one! The lighting is a bit hot on the thumbs, but still an awesome photo, man.</td>', 'You captured the perfect movement in this one! The lighting is a bit hot on the thumbs, but still an awesome photo, man.', '2006-06-07 14:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
