(2659373, 329372, 38161, '<td valign="top">WOW... genius idea there...  this would have made the first place for sure on the "perspective" challenge... incredible... i love the idea...<br/> <br/>I Would vote 11 on this shot !<br/> <br/>put on Favorite :)<br/> <br/>gl<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-25 16:41:56.</i></td>', 'WOW... genius idea there...  this would have made the first place for sure on the "perspective" challenge... incredible... i love the idea... I Would vote 11 on this shot ! put on Favorite :) gl', '2006-07-25 17:41:39.000000', '2006-07-25 17:41:56.000000', 0),
