(3261258, 329350, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like this image!  I love the sunlight and shadows that really define the shapes.  I love the DOF and the pattern it gives in the background!  The only thing distracting to me is the stem and what can you do about that?  hehe  I have tried this ''weed'' shot and got blurry images from the wind. <br/>Natures patterns can be really interesting.<br/></td>', 'I like this image!  I love the sunlight and shadows that really define the shapes.  I love the DOF and the pattern it gives in the background!  The only thing distracting to me is the stem and what can you do about that?  hehe  I have tried this ''weed'' shot and got blurry images from the wind. Natures patterns can be really interesting.', '2007-01-21 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
